<section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-4xl p-4">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border bg-card">
        <div class="px-6 py-6">
          <div class="mb-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-4">
            <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-border" ></div>
            <BadgeCn Variant="BadgeVariant.Secondary">Our Story</BadgeCn>
            <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-border"></div>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-4 text-center">
            <p class="text-sm">
              In 2018, we were a team of three working out of a cramped apartment, frustrated by the
              tools we were forced to use every day.
            </p>

            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
              We'd spend hours on tasks that should take minutes. Every tool promised to help but
              added complexity instead. So we built our own.
            </p>

            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
              What started as an internal tool became something bigger when other teams started
              asking for access. Today, thousands of companies rely on what we've built—and we're
              just getting started.
            </p>

            <p class="text-sm font-medium">
              Our mission hasn't changed: make powerful software that feels simple.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-4">
            <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-border" ></div>
            <ButtonCn Class="gap-2" Variant="ButtonVariant.Outline">
              Meet the Team
              <LucideArrowRightCn Size="16" Class="h-4 w-4" />
            </ButtonCn>
            <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-border"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

